    {
      "body": "<!-- nemo-ci-review-impact:v1 ceiling=none -->\n\nLGTM. The [bridge change](https://github.com/NVIDIA/Megatron-LM/blob/f13d8338ca61db2ddf1dd1d89649ffa07223c6e7/megatron/core/inference/engines/dynamic_engine.py#L4547-L4565) correctly limits the exception handler to loop detection, preserving coroutine errors without changing successful returns or the no-running-loop path. The [regression test](https://github.com/NVIDIA/Megatron-LM/blob/f13d8338ca61db2ddf1dd1d89649ffa07223c6e7/tests/unit_tests/inference/engines/test_dynamic_engine.py#L3216-L3229) checks the original error and exactly one coroutine execution.\n\nNo qualifying findings in this light review. Static inspection only; I didn't run tests.\n\n> **Note:** formal approval is not available for this request, so this review is posted as a comment only.\n\n*Review generated by codex. This was a full review. Request a full review with `/review reset=true`.*\n\n<!-- nemo-ci-review-rendering:inline-v1 -->\n<!-- nemo-ci-formal-review:84774c7578a487ec01ee8aa7dca9f2650db1b0904723c441b7a28a292dc2c9bb:c9b2bcc8e453d1ba29a0b9b0a52731e8988b46ccdf02ac7e67af6dbab0cbc74d -->",
